: numbers displayed with `formatNumber` using decimal places setting, but strips trailing zeros only when all decimals are zero. Let's test changing precision to 4.\n\nLet me go to Settings > Calculator and change precision. Also test each file after.\n\nPlan:\n1. Set decimal places to 4, check every result line in each file (Expenses, Monthly, Temperatures, Temp sums, Number bases, Date gaps, Time differences, Remainders, Percentages).\n2. Set to 0.\n3. Toggle precision off.\n4. Restore to 2.\n\nAlso test \"to\" keyword conversion (e.g., \"-10 celsius to fahrenheit\") and unit conversions in scratchpad maybe.\n\nLet's first check Number bases, Remainders, Percentages to know baseline (scroll home)."}
