{"type": "tool_result", "callId": "call_00_ET_97NrNBGaGXWjzPFRHavS6656", "status": "completed", "result": "Foreground: com.vishaltelangre.nerdcalci\nElements (14):\n[0] TextView \"4.9.8\" @(117,389)\n[1] TextView \"2026-10-11\" @(948,389)\n[2] TextView \"Added\" @(90,472)\n[3] TextView \"Added support for Unicode letters (including Greek math symbols like  δ ,  θ ,  α ,  λ , and scripts like Devanagari, Vietnamese, Cyrillic, CJK) and multi-word names with underscores in variable and function names (Issue: #236).\" @(540,646)\n[4] TextView \"Fixed\" @(82,831)\n[5] TextView \"Fixed Fastlane changelogs exceeding the 500-character store limit by trimming oversized entries and adding automated validation in CI and unit tests (Issue: #233).\" @(540,983)\n[6] TextView \"4.9.7\" @(117,1253)\n[7] TextView \"2026-08-26\" @(948,1253)\n[8] TextView \"Added\" @(90,1336)\n[9] TextView \"Added support for rate and compound units with automatic cancellation and conversion, e.g.,  50 liters / 2 hours = 25 L/h ,  (25 L/h) * 4 hours = 100 L ,  1000 MB / (50 MB/s) = 20 s , and  per  syntax (Issue: #160).\\nAdded bottom border divider to the last calculation row (Issue: #226).\" @(540,1556)\n[10] TextView \"Fixed\" @(82,1787)\n[11] TextView \"Fixed  prev  and  total  re-evaluating  rand()  /  randInt()  instead of preserving already computed values during incremental recalculation (Issue: #227).\\nFixed numeral system conversions (e.g.,  15 dec in hex ,  1 bin ,  1 oct ,  1 hex ) incorrectly multiplying input numbers by their base radix.\\nFixed non-numeric arguments (such as dates, date-times, and durations) being discarded or defaulting to zero when passed to global/cross-file functions (Issue: #228).\" @(540,2096)\n[12] View contains \"Back\" [clickable] @(75,148)\n[13] TextView \"Changelog\" @(540,147)"}
